This product is a clean-room implementation built from public, vendor-neutral
design-system practice. It depends on ts-morph (MIT), commander (MIT),
fast-glob (MIT), zod (MIT) and picocolors (ISC). It contains no design-system
data of its own; everything it reports is read from the repository it is
pointed at.
